# qubes-guix-packages: extra packages for an unattended Guix install
# (qubes-guix-create --unattended). Copy this next to qubes-guix-create in
# dom0 and edit it, or pass another file with --packages FILE.
#
# One or more package names per line; '#' starts a comment. name@version
# works too. Names Guix doesn't have are skipped with a warning, so a typo
# doesn't stop the install. The list ends up in the qube's /etc/config.scm
# (the packages field): change it there later, then 'qubes-guix-update -r'.
# In a template, these are in every AppVM based on it.

git

